<title>USA: ZMAX names Michel Berty chairman.</title>
<headline>ZMAX names Michel Berty chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ZMAX Corp said Wednesday it has appointed Michel Berty, former chairman and chief executive officer of Cap Gemini America, as chairman.</p>
<p>Berty retired on March 31 from Cap Gemini Sogeti.</p>
<p>Through its unit, Century Services Inc, ZMAX has developed the proprietary &quot;Vision 2000&quot; service that aims to provide changes needed to allow computers to work efficiently beyond the year 2000.</p>
</text>
